* Ethereum Dencun\n(mainnet 2024-03-13)
** Blobs (EIP-4844)
*** Tx type 0x03, 128 KiB per blob
*** KZG commitment, versioned hash
*** Blob gas: target 3, max 6, min 1 wei
*** Kept 4,096 epochs (~18 days)
*** Point evaluation precompile 0x0a
** EVM (Cancun)
*** EIP-1153: TSTORE / TLOAD, 100 gas
*** EIP-5656: MCOPY
*** EIP-6780: SELFDESTRUCT restricted
*** EIP-7516: BLOBBASEFEE
*** EIP-4788: beacon roots, 8,191 entries
left side
** Consensus (Deneb)
*** EIP-7044: exits valid across upgrades
*** EIP-7045: longer attestation window
*** EIP-7514: max 8 activations per epoch
** Impact
*** Rollups move data to blobs
*** Metamorphic contracts end
*** Cheap reentrancy locks
*** Nodes store blob sidecars
@endmindmap
